  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Now supports .NET 5 through .NET 11.\nBug fixes:\n- NumericMathConverter: the bitwise and shift operators did nothing; operators that ignore the adjustment value (ABS, SQRT, etc.) no longer require one.\n- BytesToMBFormatter: accepts any numeric type (1.5.0 only accepted long), and shows the fraction instead of truncating it (236.8MB rather than 236.0MB).\n- Numbers in a ConverterParameter are read the same way on every machine (\"0.5\" was read as 5 where the culture uses a decimal comma).\n- A bound value that cannot be converted (text that is not a number, NaN, the wrong type) now gives DependencyProperty.UnsetValue instead of throwing.\n- Visibility converters: when only the first visibility is given, the second is now its opposite, as documented.\n- ValueMatchToBooleanConverter: the fourth (not-matched) parameter is now used.\n- PathToBitmapImageConverter: web addresses, relative placeholder paths and missing network files are handled.\nPerformance: brush converters only build the brush that is used, and parsed parameters and placeholder images are cached.",
